msgid "The feeds work as for a bot (above): link posts, the newest %(first_read)s items on the first read, at most %(daily)s automated posts a day. Your own posts never count towards that."
msgstr "Iturriek bot gisa funtzionatzen dute: esteka-postuak, %(first_read)s berriena lehen irakurketako elementuak, gehienez %(daily)s mezu automatizatuak egunean. Zure postuak ez dira inoiz horretara iristen."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The first time a feed is read, only its newest %(num)s items are posted: a bot never floods the site with a feed's backlog."
msgid_plural "The first time a feed is read, only its newest %(num)s items are posted: a bot never floods the site with a feed's backlog."
msgstr[0] "Iturri bat irakurtzen den lehen aldian, bere elementu berrienak bakarrik argitaratzen dira: bot batek ez du gunea urez betetzen iturri baten backlogarekin."
msgstr[1] "Iturri bat irakurtzen den lehen aldian, %(num)s elementu berrienak bakarrik argitaratzen dira: bot batek ez du gunea urez betetzen iturri baten backlogarekin."

