#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Thirdly, %(site)s does not accept advertising or investment funding. Yes, that would make it easier to kickstart the platform, but it would also come with strings attached. We do not want to subject your free speech rights to the whims of potentially censorious funding sources."
msgstr "Hirugarrenik, %(site)sk ez du publizitaterik edo inbertsio-finantzaziorik onartzen. Bai, errazagoa izango litzateke plataforma abiaraztea, baina kateak ere erantsiko lirateke. Ez dugu zure adierazpen-eskubiderik aurkeztu nahi finantzaketa-iturri zentsuragarrien apetei."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Thirdly, %(site)s does not accept investment funding. Yes, that would make it easier to kickstart the platform, but it would also come with strings attached. It does show ads from Google AdSense, which help pay for the site. No advertiser decides what can be said here, and where Google's rules would keep an ad off a page, that page simply goes without one."
msgstr "Hirugarrenik, %(site)sk ez du inbertsioen finantzaketa onartzen. Bai, errazagoa izango litzateke plataforma abiaraztea, baina kateak ere erantsiko lirateke. Google AdSense(r)en iragarkiak erakusten ditu, webgunea ordaintzen laguntzen dutenak. Iragarle batek ez du erabakitzen zer esan daitekeen hemen, eta non Googleren arauek iragarki bat orrialdetik kenduko luketen, orri hori bat ere gabe doa."

