#, machine, plain2
msgid "When a hide, a removal, an exile, a suspension or a ban is about you, you are sent the rule, the reason and a link to its line in the Log, with an <b>Appeal</b> button. You can appeal each decision once. The guild's guildmasters decide an appeal against a guild's decision; the site's admins decide the rest. If it is reversed, a new line in the Log says so."
msgstr "Ezkutatu, kendu, erbesteratu, eseki edo debekatu bat zure inguruan dagoenean, araua, arrazoia eta esteka bidaltzen zaizkizu egunkariko bere lerrora. <b>Apelazioa</b> botoia. Erabaki bakoitza behin apela dezakezu. Guild-en moderatzaileek erabaki dute guild-aren erabakiaren aurka helegitea; administrariek erabakitzen dute gainerakoa. Alderantzizkoa bada, egunkariko lerro berri batek esaten du."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "When a post links to a video, a song or a post on another site, the post shows it:"
msgstr "Post bat bideo batera, abesti batera edo beste leku batera estekatzen denean, postak erakusten du:"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "When referring to the %(site)s social media platform, use \"%(site)s\" or \"ruqqus.com\"."
msgstr "%(site)s sare sozialeko plataformari buruz hitz egitean, erabili \"%(site)s\" edo \"ruqqus.com\"."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "When referring to the business which owns and operates the %(site)s platform, use \"%(company)s\"."
msgstr "%(site)s plataformaren jabea eta eragilea den negozioaz ari garenean, erabili \"%(company)s\"."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "When referring to the owners, staff, or other elements of %(company)s, use \"%(site)s staff\", \"%(site)s owners\", or similar phrasing."
msgstr "Jabeei, langileei edo %(company)s(r)en beste elementu batzuei buruz hitz egitean, erabili \"%(site)s staff\", \"%(site)s jabeei\", edo antzeko esaldia."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "When something is hidden, removed or erased, the site keeps a private copy of its text for 90 days (a year for illegal content, which the law requires). Who may open it depends on what it is a copy of: its author and the admins, and for a guild's hide that guild's guildmasters. Then the text is emptied; the Log's line stays."
msgstr "Zerbait ezkutatu, kendu edo ezabatzen denean, guneak 90 egunez gordetzen du bere testuaren kopia pribatua (legeak eskatzen duen legez kanpoko edukia). Nork ireki dezakeen, bere egilearen eta administratzaileen kopiaren araberakoa da, eta guild baten moderatzaileak ezkutatzeko. Orduan, testua hustu egiten da; Egunkariaren lerroa geratu egiten da."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "When you delete something"
msgstr "Zerbait ezabatzen duzunean"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Where its posts come from"
msgstr "Nondik datoz bere postuak"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Why donate?"
msgstr "Zergatik eman?"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Why is that important?"
msgstr "Zergatik da hain garrantzitsua?"

